      <h1>Understanding Your <span class="pop">Circadian Rhythm</span></h1>
      <p class="article-intro">
        A definitive, evidence-based reference for how the body's master clock actually works — the neurons that keep time, the light that resets them, and the levers you can pull to bring your rhythm back into sync.
      </p>
